{"abstract":"In this paper, I examine the online platforms that present and facilitate two highly profiled diets: the vegan meal service 22Days Nutrition and goop.com’s detoxes. 22Days Nutrition and the goop detoxes are noteworthy case studies because they showcase a shift in the way dieting is approached in the contemporary moment. Rather than being concerned exclusively with weight loss, these diets stress the emotional value and reward that their highly restrictive approach to eating offers. The diets rarely equate restrictive eating with attaining thinness or weight loss, but rather with an abstract sense of “feeling good” and overall emotional wellbeing. However, this articulation of dieting as an opportunity to enable a “positive” affective experience has larger social and political implications. The article unpacks these implications, finding that the diets’ promises of wellbeing depend on not only individual, continual self-transformation but also the formation of collectives from which some bodies must necessarily be excluded.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Kjær, Katrine Meldgaard"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-024050"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Kjær, Katrine Meldgaard"],"keyword":["Affect","Dieting culture","Eating","Food","Obesity","Politics","detox"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"detoxing feels good dieting and affect in 000000000022days nutrition and goop detoxes","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85053330599","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-024050","identifier":[{"id":"000478991600006","type":"wos"},{"id":"85053330599","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-9c15a1b6-6d0e-4873-81eb-fbaa2ef59ec2","sdu-04086c0a-4b5e-4ed1-b627-1852bdf2a019"],"keyword":["Dieting culture","OBESITY","POLITICS","affect","detox","eating","food"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-B447D8A8C7D382E0CB7FB92A2C1BA622"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Culture and Society, School of Culture and Society - Department of Anthropology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department for the Study of Culture","SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Culture and Language, Cultural Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Katrine Meldgaard","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"69b60979-fb00-413a-b33c-e44b74508b9b","name":"Kjær, Katrine Meldgaard","orcid":"0000-0001-7994-5186","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/14680777.2018.1508050","issn":["14680777","14715902"],"issn_org":["14680777"],"issue":"5","journal":"Feminist Media Studies","pages":"702-716","publisher":"Routledge","status":"p","title":"Feminist Media Studies","volume":"19"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85053330599"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-9c15a1b6-6d0e-4873-81eb-fbaa2ef59ec2","sdu-04086c0a-4b5e-4ed1-b627-1852bdf2a019"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Detoxing feels good : dieting and affect in 22Days Nutrition and goop detoxes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-024050","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
